74740_553032210438248_9007250483209227513_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-wzWqN-02cYQ7kNvwGN3wU7&_nc_oc=AdnWI0D3slZxzztF3rt3A5aXSEaOCsR4NeNQIvrsAzcExYhg2LW9yRKIElOplsfJ6Kk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afuf8XKC0GOZtqLR_QJ0mXq8JQjFLl_MKBhyjhZoEjoO0Q&oe=699992DE"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot-05.png", "id": "1063774034975181", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035371_1063774038308514_1405689482698066949_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=D2ODR9OgwvQQ7kNvwExq5cI&_nc_oc=Admt9WK_00HyAPKeWLblXRPuBK_SNWJclWwVQFknjmgDMeO8ulSiTZN4nvW0WxDENQ8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftnreD3LclPiqj2yaczjXksvjhW2Aq-Lfrsa_L7OiytzA&oe=6999A550"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "ScreenShot-01.png", "id": "8514674868623335", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035460_8514674871956668_5536053659043017688_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FU9dLZyy4p8Q7kNvwGGlZ_3&_nc_oc=AdlSTmUOakLYTONHPJEuFkiunaGvP4gV8tsrTLgMIM0fKLLaIGyyYGtUbd3-lbX7ZgY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftlSn_bfmK7Qrf10mWV7TujRXDAxk3xdXmsMHP1nS9zaw&oe=6999B262"}, "display_name": "RCP VR", "keywords": ["CPR", "Training", "FirstAid", "Life", "Medical"], "long_description": "Have you ever wondered how you would react in a medical emergency?\n\nImagine this: you're at work, in a shopping mall, or walking down the street, and suddenly, someone collapses next to you. Would you know what to do?\n\nAt Four Players VR, we\u2019ve developed a Virtual Reality Cardiopulmonary Resuscitation (CPR) simulation that trains you to act with confidence and effectiveness in critical situations.\n\nGet ready to save lives:\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator).\n\nDon\u2019t let fear paralyze you. Join us and gain the skills you need to make a difference in critical moments with Four Players VR!", "short_description": "\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator)."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Hero Cover 3000x900-01.png", "id": "1521375421828587", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982664_1521375425161920_9188152085567170692_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Vd56xlcbR5UQ7kNvwGrji9f&_nc_oc=Adlk4uLCEFSw6b_nXOhrH3TQ1387Oc2wvA0Qd6TGJaZSObQbDgFEEwfAGPr8RacfduM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuRaH1_TJnJtymIyhPOWLoirit6yN4cF9IC5UtnfCNBuQ&oe=6999BFF3"}, {"file_name": "Cover Art Square 1440x1440-01.png", "id": "1067684668157887", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75221326_1067684671491220_581184548072541025_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IrRuaKobZZgQ7kNvwHurrHX&_nc_oc=Admnw8klfKiySz9yKiC6XOVF02h--kCuQ3RMiabzzGpRpeOr_5Z0cIKmPlVu1WhhZGA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftZxuotrejZh0R8ohEL8zNP9Sk6C0Kvtl_AYWv912vhRQ&oe=6999B46B"}, {"file_name": "Logo 9000x1440-01.png", "id": "875705051208789", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75339313_875705054542122_3606485636804263314_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WyHI-BR8en0Q7kNvwFIfRk9&_nc_oc=AdnSQf796xZLxTbmG-4rMvBZ5Or9sPGt8gp2O06zKqGeAwL5QcbJlBDq07B3jQWFWbg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent